ooltip%%%短暂减速，并发动一次拥有额外伤害的攻击。", "description_en": "Teleports behind the target unit, momentarily slowing them by %slow_pct_tooltip%%% and attacking them with bonus damage if it is an enemy.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_damage", "slow", "slow_pct_tooltip", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "riki_tricks_of_the_trade", "name_zh": "力丸·绝杀秘技", "name_en": "Tricks of the Trade", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 力丸转移出现实位面，每隔一段时间从背后随机攻击附近的%interval_targets%个随机敌方单位。期间他的攻击伤害为固定值。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Riki phases out of the world and periodically strikes %interval_targets% random enemy units from behind in an area around him. He has fixed attack damage while phased out.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升施法距离至%AbilityCastRange%。可以对友方单位施放，持续时间内藏在他们体内。藏在友方单位体内时，他会拥有%scepter_movespeed%%%移动速度加成，同时绝杀秘技的持续时间提升%scepter_bonus_duration%秒，并且额外发动%scepter_bonus_attacks%次攻击。", "en": "Increases Cast Range to %AbilityCastRange%. Allows you to target an allied unit, hiding inside them for the duration. While hiding in an allied unit, they have %scepter_movespeed%%% bonus movement speed, and Tricks of the Trade lasts %scepter_bonus_duration%s longer and does an additional %scepter_bonus_attacks% attacks."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "attack_count", "speed_per_attack", "interval_targets", "attack_damage", "base_attack_damage_pct", "pocket_riki_enabled", "scepter_movespeed", "scepter_bonus_duration", "scepter_bonus_attacks", "creep_agility_multiplier", "cooldown_reduction_per_creep_kill", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "riki_innate_backstab", "name_zh": "力丸·背刺", "name_en": "Backstab", "description_zh": "力丸每次从背后攻击敌人时都会造成额外伤害，伤害量为自身敏捷的一定倍数。", "description_en": "Every time Riki strikes his enemy from behind, he deals additional bonus damage equal to a multiple of his Agility.", "notes_zh": ["反补友方单位时具有%ally_multiplier%%%效果。", "力丸的幻象也会有背刺的动作，但是不会造成额外伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_multiplier", "ally_multiplier", "backstab_angle", "bonus_xp_kill", "bonus_xp_assist", "bonus_xp_assist_other"]}, {"subject": "riki_backstab", "name_zh": "力丸·刀光谍影", "name_en": "Cloak and Dagger", "description_zh": "力丸遁入阴影，变为隐身状态，主动攻击敌人后力丸将会显形。击杀英雄和助攻会提供额外经验。", "description_en": "Riki fades into the shadows, becoming invisible until he attacks. Hero kills and assists grant additional experience.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["fade_delay", "invis_movespeed_bonus_percent", "bonus_xp_kill", "bonus_xp_assist"]}, {"subject": "enigma_malefice", "name_zh": "谜团·憎恶", "name_en": "Malefice", "description_zh": "将谜团的力量集中于一个目标，使它受到多次伤害并反复被眩晕。每%tick_rate%秒眩晕一次。", "description_en": "Focuses Enigma's power on a target, causing it to take damage and become repeatedly stunned for multiple instances.  An instance strikes every %tick_rate% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "憎恶的眩晕时间增加%shard_bonus_stun_duration_tooltip%秒，并且每次眩晕都会在目标身旁产生一个虚灵体。这些虚灵体不会再次分裂。", "en": "Increases Malefice stun duration by %shard_bonus_stun_duration_tooltip%s and creates an Eidolon next to the target every instance of Malefice stun. These Eidolons will not multiply further."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["tick_rate", "stun_duration", "shard_bonus_stun_duration_tooltip", "damage", "stun_instances", "eidolon_spawns_per_tick", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "enigma_demonic_conversion", "name_zh": "谜团·恶魔召唤", "name_en": "Demonic Summoning", "description_zh": "以生命为代价召唤三个谜团自身的碎片。虚灵的生命值会有所增加，数值为谜团当前生命值的%current_health_pct%%%。这些虚灵都由谜团控制，在反复经过几次成功的攻击后，虚灵会再次分裂，并完全回复生命值。", "description_en": "Summons three fragments of Enigma himself at the cost of health.  The eidolons health is increased by %current_health_pct%%% of Enigma's current health. These eidolons are all under Enigma's control, and repeated successful attacks cause them to multiply.  When this happens, the eidolons have their health restored.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["spawn_count", "split_attack_count", "eidelon_max_health", "life_extension", "eidelon_base_damage", "eidolon_damage_spread", "eidolon_bonus_damage", "eidolon_bonus_attack_speed", "eidelon_base_movespeed", "creep_max_level", "eidolon_magic_resist", "eidolon_attack_range", "allied_damage_pct", "self_modelscale", "spawn_offset"]}, {"subject": "enigma_midnight_pulse", "name_zh": "谜团·午夜凋零", "name_en": "Midnight Pulse", "description_zh": "使一块区域浸入暗共振中，对敌方单位造成%base_damage% + 基于敌人当前生命值的伤害。", "description_en": "Steeps an area in dark resonance, dealing %base_damage% + a percentage of the enemies current HP as damage.", "notes_zh": ["此技能将摧毁范围内的树木。", "多个午夜凋零的效果不会叠加。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "base_damage", "damage_percent", "duration", "tick_rate", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "enigma_event_horizon", "name_zh": "谜团·事件视界", "name_en": "Event Horizon", "description_zh": "%radius%范围内的单位远离谜团时会受到移速惩罚。", "description_en": "Units in a %radius% radius moving away from Enigma have a movespeed penalty.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["radius", "speed_bonus", "vision_cone"]}, {"subject": "enigma_black_hole", "name_zh": "谜团·黑洞", "name_en": "Black Hole", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 召唤一个强引力漩涡吸住敌方单位。被黑洞影响的单位不能移动、攻击或施法。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Summons a vortex that sucks in nearby enemy units.  Enemies affected by Black Hole cannot move, attack, or cast spells.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "黑洞额外造成等同于单位%scepter_pct_damage%%%最大生命值的每秒伤害，并且产生一个%scepter_radius%范围，没有打断效果的牵引效果。牵引速度为%scepter_drag_speed%。", "en": "Black Hole deals additional damage equivalent to %scepter_pct_damage%%% of the unit's Max Health per second and does a non-interrupting pull towards it in a %scepter_radius% AoE. Pulls at a rate of %scepter_drag_speed%."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "radius", "pull_speed", "tick_rate", "duration", "vision_radius", "pull_rotate_speed", "animation_rate", "scepter_pct_damage", "scepter_radius", "scepter_drag_speed", "scepter_pull_rotate_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint"]}]
